{
  "$description": "Design tokens for every geeta tool. Colours are the Figma colour variables (same names; 'brand/deep' becomes --brand-deep); the rest are the values documented on the Figma Foundations frame. A token with 'alias' points at another token: CSS gets var(--other), SCSS and JS get the resolved value. Edit here, then run `npm run build`.",
